Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.87,0:00:03.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我通過全世界媒體
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.07,0:00:07.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想向日前要求引渡羅德 吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.66,0:00:10.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,並對我國發起攻擊的PLANT最高評議會議長
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:14.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉魯巴多 狄蘭達爾先生傳達訊息
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.01,0:00:17.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是拉克絲 克萊茵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:20.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:22.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Blue Cosmos的盟主
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:25.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個向PLANT發射核彈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.82,0:00:28.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,使用大規模殺傷兵器燒燬城市
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:32.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,把孩子當成戰爭機器的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.74,0:00:35.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼奧布不惜戰鬥也要袒護他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.11,0:00:38.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們對它…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.91,0:00:43.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請不要被她的形象所迷惑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.62,0:00:49.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是拉克絲 克萊茵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:50.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.22,0:00:53.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼她人會在奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.02,0:00:56.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和我一樣長相 一樣聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:01:00.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一樣名字的人在狄蘭達爾議長身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:01.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.38,0:01:08.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然而 我身為希格爾 克萊茵之女
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.88,0:01:13.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上次大戰中與Archangel並肩作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.75,0:01:16.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在也和那時一樣與那艘船一同
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.76,0:01:19.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在奧布的阿斯哈代表身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.36,0:01:20.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.79,0:01:27.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她和我不同 信念也不同
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.10,0:01:30.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,首先要告訴大家這點
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.00,0:01:32.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 這是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.09,0:01:36.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我 我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.26,0:01:41.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我並沒有支持狄蘭達爾議長的言行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.01,0:01:55.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,停止這邊的放送
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:56.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.76,0:01:57.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.15,0:01:59.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別管了快停下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.07,0:02:02.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會被他們牽著鼻子走
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.31,0:02:02.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.16,0:02:05.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰鬥並沒有錯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.35,0:02:08.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不戰也沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:12.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,錯全在煽動戰爭的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:11.94,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1036.8,663.2)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur4}地球軍 戴達羅斯基地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:14.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,死亡商人Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.71,0:02:17.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長的話是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.39,0:02:20.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這可真是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.59,0:02:23.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是真相嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.57,0:02:27.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是自然人 也不是Coordinator
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.16,0:02:30.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,錯的是他們 世界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.15,0:02:37.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請不要陷入為自己開脫的語言陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:39.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.99,0:02:43.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}當然我並不打算袒護吉普利爾氏
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:42.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,立即聯繫奧布政府
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.90,0:02:48.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然而也不相信狄蘭達爾議長
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.21,0:02:52.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們必須看得更清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.91,0:02:56.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,狄蘭達爾議長真正的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空は飛べないけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,翼ならあるのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,慰めながら、不謹慎だけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,泣いてる顔も綺麗で焦るよ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,くじけず夢を見ることは
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自分と戦ってること
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,日ごとに増える擦り傷を
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自慢してもいいくらいさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空は飛べないけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,翼ならあげよう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それはもう一人じゃないと
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君の孤独剥がす言葉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,どんなペシミストも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恋をして変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,選んだ道がもし行き止まりなら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そこで迷えばいい
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.28,0:04:55.78,Title SEED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,350)}{\blur2.7}兩個拉克絲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.23,0:04:53.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.09,0:04:55.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會有兩個拉克絲 克萊茵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:56.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是假的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.91,0:04:58.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 在奧布…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:03.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對 再派一艘穿梭機 立刻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:06.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.69,0:05:08.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:14.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 真是個事故
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:17.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不止是妳 我也吃了一驚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:19.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.39,0:05:23.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底為何會變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:29.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是現在只好稍微改變一下計劃了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.43,0:05:32.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊才是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.81,0:05:35.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 但是狄蘭達爾議長…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.99,0:05:37.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家在說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.11,0:05:39.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT不是壞人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.28,0:05:43.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,壞的是Logos和聯合
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.86,0:05:45.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布是他們的同夥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:47.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:49.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰讓我們受苦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.36,0:05:52.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又是誰解放了我們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:55.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 都忘了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:56.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:05:58.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布是聯合的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.35,0:06:00.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰信站在他們一邊的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.63,0:06:05.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼 不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:10.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是妳暫時藏身起來較好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:13.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…但是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.23,0:06:16.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不會虧待妳
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:19.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,感謝妳的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:25.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多虧妳世界才能真正得救
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:27.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我和民眾也是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.71,0:06:30.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這我絕不會忘記
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.62,0:06:34.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以只是很短一段時間
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.13,0:06:36.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來 拉克絲小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.28,0:06:39.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.68,0:06:43.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們按計劃去Messiah
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.51,0:06:45.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,月球的聯合軍動向呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.29,0:06:48.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 目前還沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.62,0:06:49.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.16,0:06:55.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 世事真是難料啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.97,0:06:56.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:06:59.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但已經太遲了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.30,0:07:02.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事已至此了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:05.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:07.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是 怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.84,0:07:09.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 雖說是冒牌貨…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:23.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請問 艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.51,0:07:24.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別問我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:27.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是一頭霧水
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.31,0:07:32.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 唯一清楚的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:35.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的長官不是拉克絲 克萊茵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.82,0:07:41.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又不是受她的命令行事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.03,0:07:44.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦隊司令部來電
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:48.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva歸航卡潘塔利亞後
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.48,0:07:50.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,立即出發與月球艦隊會合
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.94,0:07:55.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這 這下又突然要上天嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.64,0:07:59.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:00.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:01.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:04.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.82,0:08:08.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個奧布的拉克絲 克萊茵
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:09.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷怎麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:11.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼怎麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.67,0:08:14.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:19.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊是真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.01,0:08:22.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼連你也這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:23.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:30.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣迷惑我們正是敵人的目的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:36.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕大家都會這樣在意真偽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.77,0:08:38.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,像你一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:42.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,挺有深度的心理戰嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.11,0:08:46.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:49.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼人會在意這些
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.50,0:08:53.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以為真的就都是對的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:56.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,假的就是邪惡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:02.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我不在乎那些
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.49,0:09:07.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.72,0:09:10.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長是對的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.21,0:09:12.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道這個就行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:14.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.85,0:09:27.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.24,0:09:33.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,比起那些 我們還有其他必須考慮的問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:39.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Freedom 和阿斯蘭 薩拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.33,0:09:42.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:44.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.31,0:09:47.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭…是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.41,0:09:50.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,活著待在Archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.74,0:09:55.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛這機體的就是他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.51,0:09:58.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那…梅琳也
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:02.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,梅琳也還活著嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.55,0:10:05.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:11.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但若活著 也就有可能在那艘船裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.09,0:10:31.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gounod距離預定地點還有20分
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.61,0:10:33.53,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1044.8,666.8)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur4}Gounod光束偏轉站
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:34.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem發電機運轉率85%
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:36.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,23號至55號 臨界
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.32,0:10:38.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能量傳輸良好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.62,0:10:41.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,超鏡面反射器 臨界偏差3129
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:43.63,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1097.6,664.8)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur4}全方位戰略軌道炮 鎮魂曲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.99,0:10:43.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,預備冷卻器GR啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.91,0:10:45.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,管道連接
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.27,0:10:48.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 您真的要發射這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:50.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:53.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就是為此才特地前來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:58.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,您的話真值得信賴 甚感寬心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.75,0:11:05.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我們在這種地方勤奮工作也有所回報
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.81,0:11:10.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最近以需要為由斥巨資建造
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.31,0:11:15.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,關鍵時刻又不敢發射的軟弱政治家太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:19.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣一來我們軍人到底是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.59,0:11:21.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不由得會這樣想
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.23,0:11:26.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不是總統那種膽小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.45,0:11:28.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是狄蘭達爾那種夢想家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:32.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,該出手時就出手 為了保護
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:33.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.88,0:11:48.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嘖 和報告一樣為數不少
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.56,0:11:51.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 但是到底為什麼會在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.64,0:11:57.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 不過肯定不是什麼友好設施
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.60,0:11:59.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.23,0:11:59.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.33,0:12:03.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,12宙域有奇怪舉動?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:04.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.27,0:12:08.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為是在防衛警戒區域外 行動有所遲緩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:11.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,據說有圓柱型殖民地在緩慢移動
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:13.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,向PLANT嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.07,0:12:17.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 雖然距離還有很遠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.10,0:12:24.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,前往警戒的玖爾隊 賈尼斯隊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.86,0:12:27.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目前正和其護衛艦隊作戰中
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.11,0:12:29.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.82,0:12:32.86,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1057.6,668.8)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur4}ZAFT軍機動要塞 彌賽亞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:32.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以後這個報告為最優先事項
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.88,0:12:33.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.86,0:12:48.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gounod 到達指定位置
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.45,0:12:49.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,採取制動了?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:51.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在這種地方?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.69,0:12:52.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Faure Czerny
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:55.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,姿勢穩定 力場展開中
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.55,0:12:57.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem發電機啟動中
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.61,0:12:59.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離臨界點480秒
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:02.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 想幹什麼勾當
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.09,0:13:04.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚 總之阻止他們
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.54,0:13:06.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,繞到引擎部
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:12.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,傑塞克來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:13.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:15.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才的移動殖民地有後續報告嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:17.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,至今還沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.89,0:13:19.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為目的不明
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.72,0:13:23.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以命令玖爾隊憂先考慮阻止
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.03,0:13:25.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:28.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,護衛艦隊從射線軸撤離
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.28,0:13:30.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瞄準哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.19,0:13:32.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Aprilius
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:33.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這還用說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.43,0:13:35.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是警告
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.62,0:13:39.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瞄準 PLANT首都Aprilius
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.37,0:13:42.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,輸入目標地點 Aprilius
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.84,0:13:44.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,最終保險解除
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.65,0:13:46.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全發電機提升至臨界
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:48.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第一樂章 準備完成
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.01,0:13:50.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem系統發射準備完成
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.46,0:13:53.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,擊發器開啟 開始倒計時
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:55.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離發射 T-35
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.37,0:14:07.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射權給我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.28,0:14:10.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始彈奏吧 狄蘭達爾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.25,0:14:13.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,獻給你們的Requiem
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.37,0:14:13.60,注释SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem 鎮魂曲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.17,0:14:21.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,月球背面高能量體發生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.93,0:14:23.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.37,0:14:28.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,伊扎克
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.61,0:14:30.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全軍撤離
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:34.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.79,0:14:36.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,光束彎曲了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.64,0:15:14.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:16.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:19.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:21.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡來的攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.53,0:15:24.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底發生了什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.43,0:15:27.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Januarius 1到4號直接命中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.01,0:15:29.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,December 7號8號
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.10,0:15:32.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為受到Januarius 4號撞擊損毀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.64,0:15:33.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Januarius?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:35.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:39.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 Gounod的發射角偏離了計算值
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.81,0:15:41.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是戰鬥的影響
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.95,0:15:44.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓Aprilius逃過一劫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.21,0:15:48.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:50.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Januarius?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.54,0:15:52.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有December?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:55.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.01,0:15:57.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從月球背面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.92,0:15:59.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到用這種方法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.97,0:16:00.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,堤亞哥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.93,0:16:01.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打下這東西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.54,0:16:05.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有第二發的話這次PLANT真的完了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.80,0:16:07.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無論如何都得打下來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.73,0:16:08.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:12.42,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1059.2,665.2)}{\blur3.5}ZAFT軍 卡潘塔利亞基地
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.57,0:16:12.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.44,0:16:18.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.15,0:16:31.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.25,0:16:36.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Januarius 怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.71,0:16:39.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.20,0:16:44.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼 為什麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.42,0:16:46.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.37,0:17:22.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從月球背面發射
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:26.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趁我們照常警戒正面Arzachel基地的空隙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.97,0:17:33.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Daedalus竟然有這種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.62,0:17:40.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會是從背面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.34,0:17:41.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.07,0:17:42.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.41,0:17:47.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們在廢棄殖民地中搭載了大型能量偏向裝甲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.45,0:17:50.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,分數段扭曲光束
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.02,0:17:52.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.36,0:17:55.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個系統不論炮口在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:57.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,根據扭曲點數量和位置
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.57,0:17:59.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能指哪打哪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.98,0:18:02.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,惡魔的工藝啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.01,0:18:06.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這 這種事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.37,0:18:11.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,放跑吉普利爾 是我們的責任
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:17.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼放跑吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.52,0:18:18.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.66,0:18:30.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不論怎麼說 我們當時必須殺死他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:39.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全艦 出擊準備完成
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:46.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家接連作戰一定很累
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.53,0:18:48.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到關鍵時刻了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.10,0:18:51.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在不努力就無家可歸了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.31,0:18:52.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:54.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.69,0:18:57.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎最大 Minerva出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.04,0:19:22.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和Genesis的時候一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.81,0:19:24.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經無可救藥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.07,0:19:27.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 PLANT當然是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.52,0:19:31.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事大家肯定也厭惡了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:34.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 被打後還擊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:36.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,然後又被打
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.70,0:19:38.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種戰鬥的連鎖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:42.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們現在無法斬斷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.89,0:19:50.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰都想幸福的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.30,0:19:52.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,得到幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.93,0:19:55.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為此只有戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.99,0:19:58.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我們參加戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.97,0:20:07.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長恐怕想為這個世界展示一種全新的答案
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:11.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長說的沒有戰爭的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.18,0:20:15.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人們不再有紛爭的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.43,0:20:21.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一個人天生由遺傳基因決定一切的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:23.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.07,0:20:25.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,用遺傳基因?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.34,0:20:27.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是Destiny Plan
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.20,0:20:32.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,用天生的遺傳基因決定人們的職責
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.18,0:20:37.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不稱職的人淘汰 調整 管理的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.46,0:20:40.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,淘汰 調整?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.33,0:20:42.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種世界的話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.37,0:20:45.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,的確可以使大家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.89,0:20:48.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從自己無法預知未來的不安中解脫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.22,0:20:52.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無憂無慮的生活也說不定
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.17,0:20:54.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以自己能決定的命運為代價
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:55.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,盼望得到一切力量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.05,0:20:58.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,人類出於這種祈願
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.39,0:21:02.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終於開始對遺傳基因動手
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.26,0:21:06.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是我們Coordinator社會的究極形態
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:09.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡恐怕不會有戰鬥了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.63,0:21:12.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為知道戰鬥也是徒勞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:14.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你的命運會告訴你是徒勞
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.59,0:21:17.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都知道這點而生活著
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.68,0:21:21.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他在這種社會中扮演什麼角色
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.55,0:21:23.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,王嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.85,0:21:25.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,命運才是王
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.80,0:21:26.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就是遺傳基因
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.57,0:21:29.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他算神官吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.68,0:21:31.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.22,0:21:34.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是徒勞的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.95,0:21:37.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你不做徒勞之舉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.01,0:21:48.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我 才沒那麼容易死心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.75,0:21:51.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.36,0:21:54.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:56.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是 吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.36,0:21:59.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.04,0:22:03.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上太空吧 阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.40,0:22:04.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:06.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.05,0:22:08.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,必須阻止議長
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.58,0:22:12.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,創造未來的不是命運
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.82,0:22:14.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,何も知らないほうが
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幸せというけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕はきっと滿足しないはずだから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕が選んだ今を生きたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,君の速さは僕に似ている
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,齒止めのきかなくなる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,空が怖くなって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕はいつまで頑張ればいいの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,二人ならば終わらせることができる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.24,0:23:26.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,支離破碎的日常
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.36,0:23:28.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,未能保護的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.77,0:23:32.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再也不能允許這種事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.53,0:23:34.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦再發生就無法實現
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.89,0:23:37.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悔恨化作憤怒時
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.12,0:23:39.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再次覺醒的是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.33,0:23:44.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.97,0:23:46.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,變革的序曲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.00,0:23:50.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,賭上一切出擊! Archangel
